ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Anda la osa, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Estoy buscando un mueble
grande, ¿alguna idea?
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Es que mi casa está superdesierta.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Necesito algo que le dé vidilla!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bueno, ya sabes, si se te ocurre
alguna cosa, ¡avísame!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Letztens kam mich {{TAG:0005:0004:00CD}}
besuchen und hat mir vorgeworfen,
dass ich keinen Stil hätte!
Unfassbar! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Ich und keinen Stil?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin der Stilmeister, sag ich dir!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
So 'n fieser Klappstuhl, echt!
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Argh!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Das lass ich nicht auf mir
sitzen! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich dekorier jetzt alles um{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Besorg mir doch was
Hippes für mein Haus, okay? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Egal was! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey, iyi mobilya nereden bulunur
biliyor musun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Evde fazla boş yer var,
biraz iç karartıyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Biraz daha mobilyam
olsa hayatım şenlenecek gibi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ah! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Maddiyatçı falan değilim ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}} Daha çok
misafirler rahat etsin diye istiyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} elinden çıkarmak istediğin havalı
bir mobilya varsa bana veriver, olur mu?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ne tür olduğu fark etmez!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Şu sıralar orta boy mobilyaya
fena sardım!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} Şu odaya bak.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Resmen boş alan israfı!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Sanki oda mobilyalara zorbalık ediyor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mobilyalar karşılık vermeli!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ne dersin?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Bana orta boy bir
şey bulabilir misin?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Türü fark etmez.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Kafana göre takıl, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ehi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} cosa pensi che starebbe bene
sopra un tavolo o un altro mobile
del genere?
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ho provato a copiare la foto
di una rivista mettendo {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0C0069006C0020006D0069006F000C006C00610020006D006900610002003000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
... sopra un tavolo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ma non andava.
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Non mi piaceva.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Per niente!!!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Tu hai consigli? Proposte? Idee?{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Qualcosa che non ti serve più?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi va bene tutto, basta che stia
bene su un mobile,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa, hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} İyi mobilyayı nereden
bulacağını biliyor musun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Evim fazla boş, insanı yalnız ve
üzgün hissettiriyor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Daha çok eşya koyarsam{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
daha sıcak olur kesin{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Aman! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir şey demeden söyleyeyim, kalbimdeki
boşluğu mobilyayla doldurmaya çalışmıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}O bayağı tuhaf olurdu!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Hem bekâr
olmayı seviyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Özetle{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}iyi bir mobilyaya rastlarsan
bana yolla! {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Türü fark etmez!
